"]="50 Tickets - Darkmoon Storage Box",["objectiveInstructions"]="Progress Step right up, step right up! If you have tickets from the Darkmoon Faire you'd like redeemed, then just say so! You can redeem tickets in various denominations for wondrous and fantastic prizes. Don't be shy, give it a try! Item #19182 ( 50 ) Completion Here you go, here you go! A prize fit for a king! Congratulations to you, my friend! If you have more tickets you'd like to turn in, then please let me know! For as long as the Darkmoon Faire is here, I'll redeem your tickets. Rewards You will receive: Darkmoon Storage Box See if you've already completed this by typing: /run print(C_QuestLog.IsQuestFlaggedCompleted(7934)) Related Contribute Please keep the following in mind when posting a comment: Your comment must be in English or it will be removed. Unsure how to post? Check out our handy guide ! You might want to proof-read your comments before posting them. Please post questions on our forums for quicker reply. Post a Comment You are not logged in. Please log in or register an account to add your comment. Simply browse for your screenshot using the form below. Screenshots containing UI elements are generally declined on sight, the same goes for screenshots from the modelviewer or character selection screen. The higher the quality the better! Please review our Screenshot Guidelines before submitting! You are not logged in. Please log in to submit a screenshot. Simply type the URL of the video in the form below. URL: Supported: YouTube only Title: Optional, up to 200 characters Note: Your video will need to be approved before appearing on the site. The Wowhead Client is a little application we use to keep our database up to date, and to provide you with some nifty extra functionality on the website! It serves 2 main purposes: It maintains a WoW addon called the Wowhead Looter , which collects data as you play the game! It uploads the collected data to Wowhead in order to keep the database up-to-date! You can also use it to keep track of your completed quests, recipes, mounts, companion pets, and titles! So, what are you waiting for? Download the client and get started. </html",["objectives"]={},["questID"]=7934,["raceIDs"]={},["relatedQuests"]={},["reqclass"]=nil,["reqlevel"]=6,["side"]=3,["sourceRequirements"]={},["starts"]={"bagquest:7934:1:14828"}},["84146"]={["ends"]={"bagquest:84146:1:218236","bagquest:84146:2:457056"},["evidence"]={"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=84146"},["name"]="Red Bag Blues",["objectiveInstructions"]="Locate the Red Bag that Nami in Everlook lost in a zeppelin mishap over Burning Steppes.",["objectives"]={},["questID"]=84146,["raceIDs"]={},["relatedQuests"]={},["reqclass"]=nil,["reqlevel"]=55,["side"]=nil,["sourceRequirements"]={"Faction access is not established by this published quest record."},["starts"]={"bagquest:84146:1:228216"}},["86784"]={["ends"]={"bagquest:86784:1:265812"},["evidence"]={"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=86784"},["name"]="Sticks and Bones",["objectiveInstructions"]="Collect 6 Dry Branches and bring them to Eleanor Shackleton . Dry Branch ( 6 ) Provided item: Collecting Basket ( 1 )",["objectives"]={},["questID"]=86784,["raceIDs"]={2,5,6},["relatedQuests"]={},["reqclass"]=nil,["reqlevel"]=4,["side"]=2,["sourceRequirements"]={"Published race IDs: 2, 5, 6"},["starts"]={"bagquest:86784:1:1742"}},["87288"]={["ends"]={"bagquest:87288:1:3608"},["evidence"]={"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=87288"},["name"]="Soft Saber Pelts",["objectiveInstructions"]="Bring 6 Soft Nightsaber Pelts to Aldria. Soft Nightsaber Pelt ( 6 )",["objectives"]={},["questID"]=87288,["raceIDs"]={4,95},["relatedQuests"]={},["reqclass"]=nil,["reqlevel"]=4,["side"]=1,["sourceRequirements"]={"Published race IDs: 4, 95"},["starts"]={"bagquest:87288:1:3608"}},["91741"]={["ends"]={"bagquest:91741:1:951"},["evidence"]={"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=91741"},["name"]="Nibbled-On Book",["objectiveInstructions"]="Return